00:00:57.286 --> 00:00:58.606
Seriously.

00:00:59.766 --> 00:01:00.586
It was brutal.

00:01:00.586 --> 00:01:01.887
No, really.

00:01:01.967 --> 00:01:03.587
One shoe is enough. Somebody lend me one.

00:01:03.587 --> 00:01:04.587
We were freezing too.

00:01:04.627 --> 00:01:05.687
