00:01:06.187 --> 00:01:07.908
That threw me off.

00:01:07.908 --> 00:01:08.908
It hurt.

00:01:09.288 --> 00:01:12.108
At that point I was like, "This is bad."

00:01:13.368 --> 00:01:15.269
And then we ran into Tom Brown.

00:01:15.409 --> 00:01:16.269
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:16.269 --> 00:01:17.469
Then we linked up.

00:01:17.969 --> 00:01:19.749
I was genuinely happy, honestly.

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:21.990
We'd been wandering around forever.

00:01:22.170 --> 00:01:23.410
We thought we could get outside.

00:01:23.410 --> 00:01:28.171
But once we found each other, I thought it
was over. Oh, I see.

00:01:28.171 --> 00:01:34.292
Then this nearly naked daruma showed up
where the six of us were.

00:01:34.342 --> 00:01:35.342
Then an even crazier guy showed up.

00:01:35.452 --> 00:01:37.432
At that point, nobody trusted anybody.

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:40.393
The guy who killed all the villagers.

00:01:40.393 --> 00:01:41.393
No, I didn't.

00:01:42.213 --> 00:01:44.774
And even after somebody helped me, the dog
was gone too, so...

00:01:45.574 --> 00:01:48.054
I ended up all alone, and I had no idea
what was going on, so

00:01:48.794 --> 00:01:52.995
I went into this open spot and was warming
myself there alone.

00:01:52.995 --> 00:01:53.935
Oh, I see.

00:01:53.935 --> 00:01:55.775
Then I finally heard voices, so I came
out.

00:01:56.156 --> 00:01:59.196
I thought, "Oh, there are people!" I was
happy, but

00:02:00.296 --> 00:02:02.537
it was such a different lineup than I
expected.

00:02:02.587 --> 00:02:03.587
That really was...

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:05.477
He kept saying it.

00:02:06.537 --> 00:02:07.878
He kept going, "This is the dud lineup."

00:02:08.098 --> 00:02:10.878
I still can't forget that.

00:02:10.878 --> 00:02:11.878
That pissed me off.

00:02:11.898 --> 00:02:13.458
No, but I was happy to see you.

00:02:13.558 --> 00:02:18.459
But at the time, I honestly didn't know a
thing about Takano-kun.

00:02:18.839 --> 00:02:22.200
It really felt like one random guy had
wandered into the group.

00:02:24.461 --> 00:02:25.961
I wondered if maybe nobody else could even
see him.

00:02:27.742 --> 00:02:30.303
You thought he was a ghost?
Why would I?

00:02:30.303 --> 00:02:32.543
That is how out-of-place that total
stranger felt.

00:02:32.574 --> 00:02:33.574
Exactly.

00:02:33.784 --> 00:02:34.784
Exactly.

00:02:34.844 --> 00:02:37.805
Those two were freaking out about not
having shoes,

00:02:37.805 --> 00:02:39.306
Yeah.
We had bigger problems than that.

00:02:39.566 --> 00:02:41.186
We had much bigger problems than that.

00:02:41.346 --> 00:02:42.026
It was scary.

00:02:42.026 --> 00:02:44.127
We were just like, "Let’s look around for
now."

00:02:44.327 --> 00:02:44.927
Right.

00:02:44.927 --> 00:02:45.808
Exactly.

00:02:45.808 --> 00:02:46.808
And while we were doing that,

00:02:48.769 --> 00:02:49.769
from above...

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:50.769
from above...

00:02:50.909 --> 00:02:51.909
ah...

00:02:51.909 --> 00:02:52.770
No, that part was scary.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:53.770
I had no idea what was happening.

00:02:54.221 --> 00:02:55.221
So that is what it led to.

00:02:55.231 --> 00:02:56.231
Right.

00:02:56.231 --> 00:02:57.492
We had no idea what was going on.

00:02:58.572 --> 00:03:00.473
You could see it from far away.

00:03:01.193 --> 00:03:02.853
We never expected it to show up, right?
Right.

00:03:02.853 --> 00:03:03.774
We were busy searching.

00:03:03.774 --> 00:03:06.435
I thought he was some kind of
amusement-park worker.

00:03:06.435 --> 00:03:07.435
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:03:07.435 --> 00:03:07.975
No way.

00:03:07.975 --> 00:03:11.716
But then he started coming toward us, so
we panicked and chased after him.

00:03:11.716 --> 00:03:12.716
Right.

00:03:12.857 --> 00:03:16.558
We thought he was coming to help, but when
we got close, he was the one yelling, 'Help me!'

00:03:17.238 --> 00:03:18.579
They definitely hadn't thought that
through.

00:03:18.579 --> 00:03:20.179
That was dangerous.

00:03:20.259 --> 00:03:21.780
I honestly thought it was dangerous.

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:24.080
If he'd hit us, we'd have died.

00:03:24.261 --> 00:03:25.261
We'd be dead.

00:03:25.261 --> 00:03:26.261
This is bad, this is bad.

00:03:26.302 --> 00:03:27.702
Whoa, who is that?
Who?

00:03:27.702 --> 00:03:28.382
Who? Who is it?

00:03:28.382 --> 00:03:29.362
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:03:29.362 --> 00:03:31.183
It's here, it's here, it's here!
Watch out!

00:03:31.183 --> 00:03:34.304
Watch out!

00:03:34.824 --> 00:03:35.824
Aah!

00:03:35.824 --> 00:03:36.584
Aah!

00:03:36.584 --> 00:03:37.725
Aah!
Aah!

00:03:37.725 --> 00:03:38.285
Aah!

00:03:38.285 --> 00:03:39.265
Aah!

00:03:39.265 --> 00:03:39.905
Crap!

00:03:39.905 --> 00:03:43.225
We can laugh now, but that was seriously
dangerous.

00:03:43.696 --> 00:03:45.066
Yeah.
It really was.

00:03:45.066 --> 00:03:45.646
It was seriously dangerous.

00:03:45.646 --> 00:03:48.026
Nishimura had no idea what was going on.

00:03:48.106 --> 00:03:50.087
