00:03:57.228 --> 00:03:58.228
That part was awful.

00:03:58.548 --> 00:03:59.548
That was awful.

00:03:59.548 --> 00:04:00.488
It really was awful.

00:04:00.488 --> 00:04:05.929
If we'd just stayed there, we'd have
gotten hit.

00:04:05.929 --> 00:04:07.409
What? Yeah. That laid-back attitude pissed
me off.

00:04:07.409 --> 00:04:08.010
It pissed me off.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:12.930
