00:05:23.182 --> 00:05:27.083
So we wandered around again, all of us
searching everywhere,

00:05:28.423 --> 00:05:30.143
and there he was, inside a box.

00:05:30.143 --> 00:05:30.943
Inside a box.

00:05:30.943 --> 00:05:32.224
And from there he was like, "Hey! Hey!"

00:05:32.644 --> 00:05:33.824
I hated that too.

00:05:33.964 --> 00:05:34.964
I hated that too.

00:05:34.964 --> 00:05:36.344
